                <mxCell id="_qDIwXR0BeGVKqvG6G54-33" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The user can register and log in to the system to access the skin analysis features. After logging in, they can upload skin images and answer symptom-related questions to receive AI-generated skin condition predictions and personalized recommendations. Users can also access previous scan records, monitor changes in their skin condition, and track their progress over time. This role focuses on providing users with an accessible way to analyze and monitor their personal skin health.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
